<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">13062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>After one hundred days of war between Iran and the United States, mediators say they've reached a final, agreed-upon text to end the fighting and reopen the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>Pakistan brokered the talks, placing a Muslim-majority state at the center of a settlement the West set in motion.</s> <s>A signing is expected in Europe this weekend... though both governments insist the leaked terms circulating now are false.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Three Indian merchant sailors were killed in a United States missile strike on tankers in the Gulf of Oman.</s> <s>India's foreign minister summoned Washington's envoy twice in a week and told the Secretary of State plainly that the strike wasn't justified.</s> <s>It's a rare public rupture between New Delhi and Washington — and a reminder of who actually dies in the Hormuz war the peace headlines obscure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>European Union envoys agreed to open membership talks with Ukraine and Moldova next week.</s> <s>Hungary dropped the veto it had used to freeze the process since twenty twenty-four, after striking a minority-rights deal with Kyiv.</s> <s>Budapest now promises its own referendum on Ukraine's accession, so the obstruction may simply have moved from Brussels to a ballot box.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A British judge sentenced four protesters as terrorists for a raid on an Israeli arms factory.</s> <s>It's the first time a court has attached a terrorism provision to ordinary criminal-damage charges arising from protest.</s> <s>That precedent quietly redraws the line between dissent and terror — and once drawn, such lines rarely move back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Indonesia is debating whether to return its army to a role in internal security.</s> <s>Reforms after Suharto's fall deliberately pulled the military out of domestic policing, and analysts warn that reversing them would erode civilian control.</s> <s>No legislation is tabled yet, but any change would set a precedent for soldiers' authority across Southeast Asia.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China has sanctioned the Philippines' defense secretary, Gilberto Teodoro.</s> <s>Teodoro has driven Manila's confrontational posture in the South China Sea, where Chinese and Filipino vessels collide almost monthly.</s> <s>Manila called the move an unfriendly act and said it won't change course... leaving two neighbors locked deeper into their standoff.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Nine workers died when a ladle of molten metal fell at India's state-owned Vizag steel plant.</s> <s>Management has now suspended fifteen officials and transferred nineteen more, after inspections found operational lapses and allegedly substandard materials.</s> <s>The accountability arrived only after the deaths — exposing safety enforcement that reacts to disaster rather than preventing it, with floor workers paying the difference.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The International Labour Organization passed its first binding treaty on gig work, by a vote of four hundred and six to eight.</s> <s>It bans the misclassification of workers as contractors and requires platforms to pay minimum wages — closing the loophole that has denied delivery riders and drivers basic protections worldwide.</s> <s>The United States and New Zealand voted no, so the first global floor for platform labor arrives without two of its loudest markets.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>For the first time, researchers filmed lithium metal growing inside an electron microscope as a battery charged.</s> <s>They watched how the electrolyte's anions decide whether lithium forms dangerous spikes or stable layers — the very failure that has blocked higher-capacity batteries for decades.</s> <s>Seeing the mechanism directly is what lets engineers design electrolytes to suppress it, in sha'Allah moving the next generation of batteries closer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Scientists have grown canine muscle cells in the lab to test therapies before any animal is dosed.</s> <s>The cell model narrows the field of candidate drugs upstream, cutting the number of dogs needed in early veterinary research.</s> <s>It's a concrete step in the slow shift from whole-animal testing toward laboratory models — and a test of where that substitution actually holds.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study of a cold snap nearly thirteen thousand years ago found the first direct evidence that Atlantic circulation can reorganize abruptly.</s> <s>The Gulf Stream shifted north during that ancient chill, exactly the failure mode climate scientists warn could recur as warming weakens the current.</s> <s>What happened once at the end of the last ice age is no longer just history — it's a rehearsal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A review of fifteen trials covering more than seventeen hundred patients found that AI therapy bots help with depression.</s> <s>Their benefit for anxiety and stress, though, vanished once researchers corrected for the tendency to publish only flattering results.</s> <s>That gap matters as these apps are sold as universal mental-health tools, when the evidence so far is far narrower.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Two newly launched AI models, Fable five and Mythos five, went dark everywhere outside the United States within days of release.</s> <s>A Commerce Department export-control order forced the shutdown, citing a feature that scans code for security flaws — a capability rival models share.</s> <s>Frontier AI is now treated like an export-controlled weapon, meaning a single government order can revoke a global product overnight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Egypt, the state is turning its cybercrime law inward against private life.</s> <s>Under the anti-cybercrime statute passed in twenty eighteen, security forces use dating and messaging apps to lure targets, then convert ordinary platform data into evidence without any physical act.</s> <s>It's the same surveillance architecture that elsewhere hunts dissidents, here repurposed to police who people are and whom they love.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two dozen experts from ten countries have validated an open data model for pharmacogenetics — the science of matching drugs to a patient's genes.</s> <s>The advance keeps stalling not on biology but on plumbing: test results can't flow into the systems doctors use to prescribe.</s> <s>No health system has adopted the model yet, a clean reminder that interoperability, not discovery, often decides whether medicine reaches the patient.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>